Mon Nov 23 06:15:31 UTC 2026 - Frederic Crozat <fcrozat@suse.com>
- Initial package: herdr-core, the core that keeps agent and build terminals
  alive across windows and SSH connections, with the hc command line.
- Sources are taken from the v0.1.21 tag with obs_scm (the vendor/ghostty
  submodule included); the Rust crates are vendored with
  obs-cargo-vendor-standard-service and the Zig packages with vendor-zig.sh,
  so the build needs no network.
